      "evidence": "etree.fromstring(xml_bytes, parser)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The parser is not configured with 'huge_tree=False' or 'resolve_entities=False', making the application vulnerable to exponential entity expansion attacks that can exhaust memory.",
      "suggested_fix": "Set resolve_entities=False and ensure huge_tree=False (default) in the XMLParser."
